{"id": "9nq9ocivltk", "title": "Ordering at a Coffee Shop English Speaking: How to Order Coffee in English Conversation", "channel": "English Together", "duration": 112, "auto": false, "lines": [{"i": 0, "s": 12.67, "e": 14.34, "en": "Good morning!", "ko": "좋은 아침이에요!"}, {"i": 1, "s": 14.4, "e": 17.47, "en": "Can I get a coffee, please?", "ko": "커피 한잔 주시겠어요?"}, {"i": 2, "s": 18.18, "e": 19.9, "en": "Good morning!", "ko": "좋은 아침이에요!"}, {"i": 3, "s": 19.9, "e": 21.95, "en": "Absolutely.", "ko": "전적으로."}, {"i": 4, "s": 21.95, "e": 24.77, "en": "What type of coffee would you like?", "ko": "어떤 종류의 커피를 원하시나요?"}, {"i": 5, "s": 25.54, "e": 28.48, "en": "I'll have a cappuccino, please.", "ko": "카푸치노 한잔 주세요."}, {"i": 6, "s": 29.82, "e": 33.02, "en": "Medium size, if possible.", "ko": "가능하다면 중간 크기입니다."}, {"i": 7, "s": 33.73, "e": 35.52, "en": "Sure thing.", "ko": "확실한 것."}, {"i": 8, "s": 36.22, "e": 39.68, "en": "Would you like it for here or to go?", "ko": "여기로 가실 건가요, 아니면 가실 건가요?"}, {"i": 9, "s": 40.19, "e": 43.39, "en": "I'll have it to go, please.", "ko": "제가 가져가도록 하겠습니다."}, {"i": 10, "s": 43.84, "e": 46.59, "en": "Alright. Anything else?", "ko": "괜찮은. 다른 건 없나요?"}, {"i": 11, "s": 48.38, "e": 53.31, "en": "Actually, can I also get a chocolate chip muffin?", "ko": "사실, 초코칩 머핀도 먹을 수 있나요?"}, {"i": 12, "s": 54.08, "e": 55.81, "en": "Of course.", "ko": "물론."}, {"i": 13, "s": 55.81, "e": 58.26, "en": "One chocolate chip muffin.", "ko": "초코칩 머핀 1개."}, {"i": 14, "s": 58.26, "e": 59.96, "en": "Anything else?", "ko": "다른 건 없나요?"}, {"i": 15, "s": 61.6, "e": 65.19, "en": "Just the cappuccino and the muffin, please.", "ko": "카푸치노와 머핀만 주세요."}, {"i": 16, "s": 66.08, "e": 67.68, "en": "Alright.", "ko": "괜찮은."}, {"i": 17, "s": 67.82, "e": 70.06, "en": "That will be $8.", "ko": "8달러가 될 거예요."}, {"i": 18, "s": 70.06, "e": 72.49, "en": "Cash or card?", "ko": "현금인가, 카드인가?"}, {"i": 19, "s": 73.26, "e": 76.14, "en": "I'll pay with card, please.", "ko": "카드로 결제하겠습니다."}, {"i": 20, "s": 77.93, "e": 79.92, "en": "Here's your receipt.", "ko": "여기 영수증이 있습니다."}, {"i": 21, "s": 79.92, "e": 83.69, "en": "Your order will be ready in just a few minutes.", "ko": "몇 분 안에 주문이 준비됩니다."}, {"i": 22, "s": 84.84, "e": 87.28, "en": "Great, thank you!", "ko": "좋습니다. 감사합니다!"}]}